From 85415de538353a223bb042c1feff999d96b7e73c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: redducc <sushmit718@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 11:56:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Edit One UI Quick Settings card by card

One UI now lays out on the Control Centre's grid with its own layout, cards and sizes, so every card is dragged, resized, taken out and added back as on One UI; tiles with no place of their own gather in the card of toggles, whose Edit opens the tile editor.
